From 83f34df696f72dea73b2900f1cef323c04fde1b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:18:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] turnip/a5xx: add compute bring-up for Adreno 509

Add the isolated compute path used on the Adreno 509: descriptor sets, SSBO/UBO loads, push constants, descriptor arrays, indirect dispatch and the userspace-VA/vm_bind fallback.  UCHE is invalidated before dispatches on this generation.

Signed-off-by: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
